# The public OAuth client ID for the YouTube Data API.
#
# Every VITE_-prefixed variable is inlined into the bundle at build time and is
# therefore readable by anyone who views source. A client ID is a public
# identifier by design, so that is fine. A client secret or an API key must
# never be given a VITE_ name, and an access token is never configured at all:
# it is fetched at runtime and kept in the tab that fetched it.
#
# Leave this unset and there is nothing to sign in to and nothing to schedule:
# the set shows the no-service-configuration fault card.
VITE_YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=
